s, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"RvTHIKHaPVVp8S9cihpi5w","review_id":"eTyDNqY6JdJtILDaxz5dIA","date":"2013-01-22T16:13:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9450609683990479,"text_excerpt":"One of my favourite music spots in New Orleans. No matter what night I passed by top-notch, lively jazz could be heard from the doorway. We went in on a Friday night and there was a band playing 30/40s style tunes and as many people as could pack onto the little dancefloor swinging their thing. There's a really upbeat and very friendly feel to the place. This gig was a tip-per-set which is nice considering a lot of the clubs are $10-20 in. The bar was also very reasonable for a club with a wide range of local beers to sample. If only I could get back there sometime soon.. c*"},{"business_id":"RvTHIKHaPVVp8S9cihpi5w","review_id":"tJFdMRfJ8_zSEPecsGGL6g","date":"2018-05-19T17:53:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9419683218002319,"text_excerpt":"Everyone told me to come here during my first NOLA visit, and it did not disappoint! Great live music, small intimate venue, and no cover charge. You should definitely support your local talent however, and bring cash for the tip bucket that comes around. I walked in some time after 8pm and it was extremely crowded. Definitely a standing room only situation at that time. I walked to the back of the room and was able to order a drink rather quickly. The bartender was extremely friendly, and the drinks are your typical, reasonable dive-bar prices. CASH ONLY though. I even came back the next day searching for my lost mini-tripod, and everyone was sympathetic when they couldn't find it. There..."},{"business_id":"RvTHIKHaPVVp8S9cihpi5w","review_id":"ZpDGxWujK8-tYcTda5rEPg","date":"2011-09-26T18:18:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9409029483795166,"text_excerpt":"Pretty freaking fabulous. No cover, the band will holler at you \"one drink minimum\" (not enforced) but feel free to drink here, because they put on a good show and they deserve it. 1 mixed drink was $7, which is pretty good given you're not paying a cover & get music. The crowd here is eclectic for sure. Went her on a Girls Night Out and it was the perfect place. All ages can be found here, and you'll get some cute little hipsters showing off their dancing skills. And the good ones come here, so be prepared to watch, ooh and ahh, they're that good. Their's some seating in the back and dancing towards the front. Very close to other bars on Frenchman to enjoy more jazz or other types of mus..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RvTHIKHaPVVp8S9cihpi5w","photo_id":"ceZzHpbD7rh4Ut9JrGMtOg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ceZzHpbD7rh4Ut9JrGMtOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9182464480400085},{"business_id":"RvTHIKHaPVVp8S9cihpi5w","photo_id":"IrYD6muepdeIahl_eR7I9Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/IrYD6muepdeIahl_eR7I9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8890630602836609},{"business_id":"RvTHIKHaPVVp8S9cihpi5w","photo_id":"RgMJTyNRVq